\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My God! I know, I feel Thee mine,
\par And will not quit my claim,
\par Till all I have is lost in Thine
\par And all renewed I am.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I hold Thee with a trembling hand,
\par But will not let Thee go,
\par Till steadfastly by faith I stand
\par And all Thy goodness know.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus, Thine  all-victorious love
\par Shed in my heart abroad;
\par Then shall my feet no longer rove,
\par Rooted and fixed in God.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. O that in me the sacred fire
\par Might now begin  to glow,
\par Burn up the dross of base desire,
\par And make the mountains flow!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. O that it now from heaven might fall,
\par And all my sins consume!
\par Come, Holy Ghost, for Thee I call,
\par Spirit of burning, come!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Refining Fire, go through my heart,
\par Illuminate my soul;
\par Scatter Thy life through every part,
\par And sanctify the whole.
\par                          Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

